& [P8GeneratedPathPolicyAndProofRunnerContractV1] is the P8-IA05 generated path policy and proof runner contract
  + [slice_id] is P8-IA05
  + [slice_name] is generated path policy and proof runner contract
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_depth] is deeper_reasoning_required
  + [contract_result] is generated_path_policy_and_proof_runner_contract_defined_without_code_or_generated_outputs
  + [next_gate_result] is P8-IA06 may open after completion review
  + [next_model_route] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable for validation tests and generated-output/no-live-effect proof after this contract is accepted
  + [fixture_source_file_creation_authorized] is false
  + [expected_ledger_creation_authorized] is false
  + [generated_output_creation_authorized] is false_by_this_slice
  + [proof_runner_code_creation_authorized] is false_by_this_slice
  + [test_file_creation_authorized] is false_by_this_slice
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [transport_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [assignment_authorized] is false
  + [dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat this file as contract authority for future P8 fixture proof validation, not proof runner implementation code
  = must: keep generated outputs ignored, disposable, rebuildable, stale-markable, and non-authoritative
  = must: keep proof runner effects bounded to in-memory comparison and future ignored generated-output writes under accepted generated roots
  = must: reject any proof runner behavior that writes source fixtures, expected ledgers, proof ledgers, canonical specifications, source manifests, mailboxes, credentials, dispatch records, operations targets, or live-control targets

& [P8AcceptedReadRootPolicy] is the read policy for future P8 proof runner validation
  + [accepted_fixture_source_root] is tests/fixtures/sop/p2_authority_kernel/
  + [accepted_fixture_source_root] is tests/fixtures/sop/p3_operator_contracts/
  + [accepted_fixture_source_root] is tests/fixtures/sop/p4_packetization/
